Package: parkeze-mqtt
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: mosquitto-client-ssl, jsonfilter
Source: parkeze
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: Manage a gateway over MQTT instead of its web console.
 Answers a fixed set of questions and performs a fixed set of actions on the
 connection the gateway already holds, so that reading a gateway's state costs
 a few hundred bytes rather than the console's quarter-megabyte bundle. Every
 operation is enumerated in the agent; there is no "run this".
